  :question/id #uuid "97f7abe5-b804-538b-ae3d-2c4906de5a17"
  :question/problem "**(a)** Find the general solution. Use $c_1,c_2$ for arbitrary constants and $x$ as the independent variable. In WeBWorK enter the full equation $y=\\cdots$, typing the constants as `c1` and `c2`.\n\nEquation: $y=$ {{solution}}."
  :question/answer-fields ["d2853a76-9b00-5684-b828-733b7ffa7f60"]
  :question/worked-solution "The characteristic polynomial is $(r-3)^2$. A double root gives two independent solutions $e^{3x}$ and $xe^{3x}$, so $y=(c_1+c_2x)e^{3x}$."
  :db/ensure :question/validate}
