  :question/id #uuid "76808fe3-9935-5a8a-bfbf-9fdbb174d575"
  :question/problem "**(b)** Find the solution satisfying $y(0)=5$ and $y'(0)=0$.\n\nEquation: $y=$ {{solution}}."
  :question/answer-fields ["e9d20b33-0a1f-5753-b09c-71158d36a1b4"]
  :question/worked-solution "Using $y=(A+Bx)e^{3x}$, $y(0)=A=5$. Differentiation gives $y'(0)=B+3A=0$, hence $B=-15$. The resulting solution satisfies both initial conditions."
