  :question/id #uuid "c537203a-3a2e-5b3f-b901-0a3c361f3090"
  :question/problem "Find the solution to the original nonhomogeneous equation satisfying $y(0)=6$ and $y'(0)=3$.\n\n$y=$ {{solution}}."
  :question/answer-fields ["c9558970-7b7f-5f74-9c1e-a64d33983864"]
  :question/worked-solution "Using the particular solution $y_p=x(\\sin(3x)-\\cos(3x))/6$, we have $y_p(0)=0$ and $y_p'(0)=-1/6$. For $y=A\\cos(3x)+B\\sin(3x)+y_p$, the conditions give $A=6$ and $3B-1/6=3$, hence $B=19/18$."
  :db/ensure :question/validate}
